>You found a trap on a chest while not confused. This exercises wisdom.

(Continuing incomplete message, hit "send" too fast...)

To actually increase the stat, you would have had to have another
exercise, because the exercise counter is divided by 2 before checking,
and 1/2==0. From reading exerchk(), it should not be possible with just
one exercise.

